# IMPORTANT: This file must be managed by mosquitto_passwd tool.
# Do NOT edit manually. Passwords are BCrypt-hashed by Mosquitto.
#
# Default placeholder entries (replace with real hashed entries via setup_mqtt.sh):
# esp32_node:$7$101$<hash>
# edge_controller:$7$101$<hash>
